{"lyrics":"[00:09.36]And we sippin' purple, nigga, yeah\n[00:11.88]Honestly, Honestly (Ayy, Southside, Where You Get All That Drip?)\n[00:20.24]Everything I wanna be, gotta work 'til it come to me\n[00:21.62]Ain't wanna be no wannabe, wannabes, they under me\n[00:23.56]Honestly, I wanna be, on the beach, white sand up under me, comfortably (Comfortably)\n[00:26.16]I just want 100 G's (100 G's), foreign V's (Foreign V's)\n[00:27.76]Louis V (Louis V), they like, \"Who is he-he?\" (Who is he?)\n[00:41.96]Honestly, when I was broke as fuck, you ain't notice me *You ain't notice me)\n[00:44.62]You thought days I was posted up at the county jail where I'm 'posed to be\n[00:47.90]Now young nigga eating overly (I'm overly), I got hunnids old as trees (Old as trees)\n[00:51.68]And money don't grow on trees (Money don't grow, ayy), but I'm gon' blow it like leaves, ayy (Blow like leaves, ayy)\n[00:55.92]Pull up with turbo V's, ayy, two-door AMG's, ayy (Ayy)\n[00:58.82]I started witnessing some of the shit that felt like it was make-believe, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:02.18]Lil' nigga neck on freeze, ayy, spent 100 racks on these, ayy\n[01:05.46]Seen't 'em tryna keep up and then lost everything, I can't let that happen to me, ayy\n[01:10.52]Feeling alive, I'm so happy to be, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:13.40]You killing my vibe, fuck how long you bitches you see me, be happy for me, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:16.82]I'm fresh all the time, but you know my kicks ain't Buscemi\n[01:19.18]Capital G Fazos, Nike need me on the payroll, I just took these off a day ago\n[01:24.46]Killers gon' do what I say so, angels gon' give you a halo\n[01:27.94]And we got money to lay low\n[01:29.64]Now when it come to the bread, I go with it like mayo\n[01:33.06]Can't let it go to my head, I had way too many days broke\n[01:36.42]Honestly, Honestly (Ayy, Southside, Where You Get All That Drip?)\n[01:44.10]Everything I wanna be, gotta work 'til it come to me\n[01:47.10]Ain't wanna be no wannabe, wannabes, they under me\n[01:50.54]Honestly, I wanna be, on the beach, white sand up under me, comfortably (Comfortably)\n[01:57.66]I just want 100 G's (100 G's), foreign V's (Foreign V's)\n[02:00.72]Louis V (Louis V), they like, \"Who is he-he?\" (Who is he?)\n[02:05.20]I say honestly, I need honesty (I need honesty)\n[02:08.36]Get rich and I make my mama proud of me (Proud of me)\n[02:11.78]A young rich nigga, that's what I'm 'bout to be (What I'm bout' to be)\n[02:15.28]Rolling gas, boy, yo' shit not loud to me (Got gas)\n[02:18.58]I'm getting used to the fake niggas crowding me (Get back)\n[02:22.44]I got demons and these niggas brought 'em out of me (Get back)\n[02:25.92]I'm on my boss shit, ain't no clowning me (No, ah)\n[02:28.98]Let's fuck up Saks Fifth, hit the town on me (Run it)\n[02:33.26]Me and Herbo pull up in a Bentley coupe (Skrrt, skrrt-skrrt)\n[02:36.64]Ain't no telling what we'll say or what we'll do (Run it, run it, run it)\n[02:40.36]Smoke Gelato out the zip, feel like jet fuel (Run it, run it, run it)\n[02:43.18]We'll never let a fuck nigga know our next move (No)\n[02:46.64]Run up them big bags (Run it), that's what we into (That's what we into)\n[02:50.12]We just some real niggas (Real), look what we been through (Look what we been through)\n[02:53.48]I put Gucci on my backpack (Boujee), but I don't like school (But I don't like school)\n[02:56.98]I know you may love me (Right), but bitch, I don't like you (Like you)\n[03:00.52]Honestly, Honestly (Ayy, Southside, Where You Get All That Drip?)\n[03:07.30]Everything I wanna be, gotta work 'til it come to me\n[03:10.16]Ain't wanna be no wannabe, wannabes, they under me\n[03:13.98]Honestly, I wanna be, on the beach, white sand up under me, comfortably (Comfortably)\n[03:21.14]I just want 100 G's (100 G's), foreign V's (Foreign V's)\n[03:25.32]Louis V (Louis V), they like, \"Who is he-he?\" (Who is he?)","words":[[9.36,9.52,"And"],[9.56,9.58,"we"],[9.78,10.2,"sippin'"],[10.34,10.78,"purple,"],[10.84,11.08,"nigga,"],[11.12,11.84,"yeah"